<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Alegra Board — Discussion Topics</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="../styles/base.css">
  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/Chart.js/4.4.1/chart.umd.js"></script>
  <style>
    /* ── Section cover ── */
    .section-divider {
      background: var(--color-navy);
      justify-content: center;
      padding: var(--slide-pad-y) var(--slide-pad-x);
    }
    .section-divider .eyebrow {
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-teal);
      letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .section-divider .section-title {
      font-size: 38px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff;
      letter-spacing: -1.2px; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 14px; max-width: 640px;
    }
    .section-divider .topic-label {
      font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.40);
    }
    .section-divider .slide-num {
      position: absolute; bottom: 24px; right: var(--slide-pad-x);
      font-size: 10px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>


  <!-- ================================================================
       DISCUSSION TOPIC — NDR
       Portada + comentario histórico sin cambios (ver debajo de la portada
       para el historial completo de pasadas hasta v3).

       ACTUALIZADO 2026-09-28 (v4, "NDR Board Pack"): Luis Caro reemplazó
       SOLO las slides 1 y 2 (las de tabla: "NDR by Version" → ahora "NDR by
       Market", y "Pricing and Upselling..." → ahora "How NDR Has Evolved")
       con un handoff HTML nuevo ("2026-09-28-ndr-board-pack.html", pegado
       directo por Sebastián). Confirmado por Luis: "las gráficas son
       iguales" — mismos números que v3, solo cambia el layout/diseño de
       esas 2 slides. Las slides 3 y 4 (los charts "NDR Global" y "FX
       Effect por país") NO se tocaron, siguen exactamente igual que en v3
       — confirmado con el usuario antes de aplicar (primera pasada había
       reemplazado las 4 por error). Clases con prefijo ndr- para las 2
       slides nuevas (autocontenido, no usa .slide/.slide-header genéricos
       de base.css) — registrado "ndr-slide" en
       board_agent/paths.py::SLIDE_CLASS_TOKENS. El wrapper de presentación
       standalone (.ndr-doc/.ndr-stage, fondo gris, centrado) del HTML
       original se descartó — es solo para previsualizar el archivo suelto
       en un browser. El divisor ".ndr-div" del original también se
       descartó a favor del ".slide-divider" estándar que ya usa el resto
       del deck (mismo look, una sola definición). -->
  <div class="slide section-divider">
    <div class="eyebrow">Alegra's NRR</div>
    <div class="section-title">NDR:<br>Analysis by Cohort</div>
    <div class="topic-label">{{ config.month_label }}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="slide-divider">↓ &nbsp; 1 / 4</div>

  <style>
  /* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     NDR Board Pack — Discussion Topic, slides 1/2 and 2/2
     Todas las clases van con prefijo ndr- y el shell de slide es
     autocontenido (.ndr-slide, no .slide) para que este bloque pueda
     pegarse dentro del HTML del board sin chocar con su CSS global —
     es el mismo problema ya documentado en el board (la regla suelta
     .slide{...} que pisaba el fondo navy de la portada).
     ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

    :root{
      --ndr-navy:#0f172b;
      --ndr-bg:#ffffff;
      --ndr-surface:#f8fafc;
      --ndr-border:#e2e8f0;
      --ndr-teal:#14b8a6;
      --ndr-teal-dk:#1a7e7f;
      --ndr-neg:#b42318;
      --ndr-txt:#0f172b;
      --ndr-txt-2:#475569;
      --ndr-muted:#94a3b8;
      --ndr-fx:#2a78d6;
    }

    /* ── shell ── */
    .ndr-slide{
      width:960px; height:540px; flex-shrink:0;
      background:var(--ndr-bg); border-radius:10px;
      box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.10), 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
      display:flex; flex-direction:column; overflow:hidden;
    }
    .ndr-hd{
      background:var(--ndr-navy); padding:15px 40px;
      display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; flex-shrink:0;
    }
    .ndr-hd-t{ color:#fff; font-size:15px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:-0.2px; font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; }
    .ndr-hd-p{ color:var(--ndr-teal); font-size:12px; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:0.3px; font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; }

    .ndr-ft{
      display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
      padding:7px 40px 11px; flex-shrink:0; border-top:1px solid var(--ndr-border);
    }
    .ndr-ft-b{ font-size:9px; color:var(--ndr-muted); font-weight:500; letter-spacing:0.5px; font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; }
    .ndr-ft-s{ font-size:8.5px; color:var(--ndr-muted); font-style:italic; font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; }
    .ndr-ft-p{ font-size:9px; color:var(--ndr-muted); font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; }

    .ndr-sub{ font-size:10.5px; color:#64748b; font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; }

    /* shared numeric semantics */
    .ndr-neg{ color:var(--ndr-neg); }
    .ndr-fx{ color:var(--ndr-fx); }
    .ndr-nil{ color:#cbd5e1; }
    .ndr-base{ color:var(--ndr-muted); font-weight:500; }

    /* ══════════ SLIDE 1 — NDR by Market ══════════ */
    .ndr-mkt-row{ flex:1; display:flex; overflow:hidden; }
    .ndr-mkt-wrap{ flex:1; padding:16px 10px 0 40px; overflow:hidden; display:flex; flex-direction:column; }
    .ndr-mkt-wrap .ndr-sub{ margin-bottom:12px; }

    table.ndr-mkt{ width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; }

    table.ndr-mkt thead tr.ndr-mkt-h{ background:var(--ndr-navy); }
    table.ndr-mkt thead tr.ndr-mkt-h th{
      text-align:right; font-size:9px; font-weight:600; text-transform:uppercase;
      letter-spacing:.5px; color:var(--ndr-muted); padding:7px 9px; white-space:nowrap;
      font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;
    }
    table.ndr-mkt thead tr.ndr-mkt-h th:first-child{ text-align:left; padding-left:6px; color:#fff; width:118px; }
    table.ndr-mkt thead tr.ndr-mkt-h th.ndr-c-ndr{
      color:#fff; border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18); border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
    }
    table.ndr-mkt thead tr.ndr-mkt-h th.ndr-c-fx{ border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18); }

    table.ndr-mkt thead tr.ndr-mkt-sub th{
      text-align:center; font-size:8px; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase;
      letter-spacing:.4px; color:var(--ndr-teal-dk); background:#eaf6f4;
      padding:2px 9px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--ndr-border);
      font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;
    }
    table.ndr-mkt thead tr.ndr-mkt-sub th.ndr-blank{ background:var(--ndr-surface); }

    table.ndr-mkt tbody td{
      text-align:right; padding:0 9px; height:30px;
      font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:11.5px; color:var(--ndr-txt-2);
      white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle; border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;
    }
    table.ndr-mkt tbody td:first-child{
      text-align:left; font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; font-weight:600;
      font-size:12px; color:var(--ndr-txt); padding-left:6px;
    }
    table.ndr-mkt tbody tr:nth-child(odd){ background:rgba(248,250,252,0.7); }

    table.ndr-mkt td.ndr-c-ndr{
      font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:13px; color:var(--ndr-txt);
      border-left:1px solid var(--ndr-border); border-right:1px solid var(--ndr-border);
    }
    table.ndr-mkt td.ndr-c-fx{ color:var(--ndr-fx); border-left:1px solid var(--ndr-border); }

    sup.ndr-fn{ font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; font-size:8px; font-weight:700; color:var(--ndr-teal-dk); margin-left:1px; }

    table.ndr-mkt tr.ndr-tot td{
      border-top:1.5px solid var(--ndr-navy) !important;
      border-bottom:3px double var(--ndr-navy) !important;
      background:var(--ndr-surface);
      font-weight:700 !important;
      color:var(--ndr-navy) !important;
      height:32px;
    }
    table.ndr-mkt tr.ndr-tot td:first-child{ font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:800 !important; }
    table.ndr-mkt tr.ndr-tot td.ndr-c-ndr{ font-size:14px; color:var(--ndr-navy) !important; }
    table.ndr-mkt tr.ndr-tot td.ndr-c-fx{ color:var(--ndr-fx) !important; }

    .ndr-mkt-notes{ margin-top:9px; font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; font-size:9px; color:var(--ndr-muted); line-height:1.5; }
    .ndr-mkt-notes sup{ font-weight:700; color:var(--ndr-teal-dk); }

    .ndr-rail{
      width:214px; flex-shrink:0; padding:22px 40px 14px 16px;
      border-left:1px solid var(--ndr-border);
      display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:11px;
    }
    .ndr-rail-l{
      font-size:8.5px; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase;
      letter-spacing:1.4px; color:var(--ndr-muted); font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;
    }
    .ndr-note{ display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:flex-start; }
    .ndr-note-n{
      font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:9.5px; font-weight:700; color:var(--ndr-teal-dk);
      flex-shrink:0; width:12px;
    }
    .ndr-note-t{ font-size:10.5px; font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; color:var(--ndr-txt-2); line-height:1.5; }
    .ndr-note-t b{ color:var(--ndr-txt); font-weight:700; }
    .ndr-note-hr{ height:1px; background:var(--ndr-border); width:100%; }

    /* ══════════ SLIDE 2 — NDR bridge ══════════ */
    .ndr-br-wrap{ flex:1; padding:20px 40px 0; overflow:hidden; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; }
    .ndr-br-wrap .ndr-sub{ margin-bottom:14px; align-self:flex-start; }
    .ndr-br-center{ width:100%; display:flex; justify-content:center; }

    table.ndr-br{ border-collapse:collapse; table-layout:fixed; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; }
    table.ndr-br col.ndr-br-c1{ width:150px; }
    table.ndr-br col.ndr-br-cp{ width:70px; }
    table.ndr-br col.ndr-br-ce{ width:124px; }

    table.ndr-br thead tr{ background:var(--ndr-navy); }
    table.ndr-br thead th{
      text-align:right; font-size:8.5px; font-weight:600; text-transform:uppercase;
      letter-spacing:.5px; color:var(--ndr-muted); padding:7px 8px; white-space:nowrap;
      font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;
    }
    table.ndr-br thead th:first-child{ text-align:left; padding-left:8px; color:#fff; }
    table.ndr-br thead th.ndr-br-per{ color:#fff; }
    table.ndr-br thead th.ndr-br-per.ndr-cur{ color:#5eead4; }
    table.ndr-br thead th.ndr-br-exp{ text-align:left; padding-left:16px; }

    table.ndr-br tbody td{
      text-align:right; padding:5.5px 8px;
      font-family:'DM Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; color:var(--ndr-txt-2);
      white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:middle; border-bottom:1px solid var(--ndr-border);
    }
    table.ndr-br tbody td:first-child{
      text-align:left; font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; font-weight:600;
      font-size:11px; color:var(--ndr-txt); padding-left:8px;
    }
    table.ndr-br tbody tr.ndr-br-r:nth-child(odd){ background:rgba(248,250,252,0.7); }
    table.ndr-br tbody td.ndr-cur{ background:rgba(20,184,166,0.07); color:var(--ndr-teal-dk); font-weight:600; }

    table.ndr-br td.ndr-br-e{
      text-align:left; padding-left:16px; white-space:nowrap;
      font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; font-size:10.5px; font-weight:600; color:#334155;
      vertical-align:middle;
    }
    table.ndr-br td.ndr-br-e.ndr-mut{ color:var(--ndr-muted); font-style:italic; font-weight:500; }
    table.ndr-br td.ndr-br-e.ndr-tbd{ color:var(--ndr-muted); font-style:italic; font-weight:700; }

    table.ndr-br tr.ndr-br-glbl td{
      padding:2px 8px; font-size:7.5px; font-weight:700; color:var(--ndr-teal-dk);
      text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.4px; background:#eaf6f4;
      border-bottom:1px solid #cdeee9; font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;
    }
    table.ndr-br tr.ndr-br-g td{ background:#f5fbfa; }
    table.ndr-br tr.ndr-br-g td:first-child{ border-left:2px solid var(--ndr-teal); padding-left:6px; }

    table.ndr-br tr.ndr-br-ndr td{
      border-top:1.5px solid var(--ndr-navy) !important;
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--ndr-navy) !important;
      background:var(--ndr-surface);
      font-weight:700 !important;
      color:var(--ndr-navy) !important;
      padding-top:7px; padding-bottom:7px;
    }
    table.ndr-br tr.ndr-br-ndr td:first-child{ font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; font-size:11.5px; font-weight:800 !important; }
    table.ndr-br tr.ndr-br-ndr td.ndr-br-v{ font-size:12.5px; font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; }
    table.ndr-br tr.ndr-br-ndr td.ndr-cur{ background:rgba(20,184,166,0.14); color:var(--ndr-teal-dk) !important; }
    table.ndr-br tr.ndr-br-ndr td.ndr-br-e{ color:#334155 !important; font-weight:700 !important; font-style:normal; }

    /* memo line — derivada, se distingue de las filas con fuente */
    table.ndr-br tr.ndr-br-memo td{
      border-bottom:3px double var(--ndr-navy) !important;
      background:var(--ndr-surface);
      font-style:italic; color:#64748b !important; font-size:10.5px;
      padding-top:5px; padding-bottom:6px;
    }
    table.ndr-br tr.ndr-br-memo td:first-child{
      font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; font-size:10.5px; font-weight:600;
      color:#64748b !important; padding-left:8px;
    }
    table.ndr-br tr.ndr-br-memo td.ndr-cur{ background:rgba(20,184,166,0.10); color:var(--ndr-teal-dk) !important; }

    .ndr-br-fn{ margin-top:12px; font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; font-size:8.5px; color:var(--ndr-muted); line-height:1.45; align-self:flex-start; max-width:760px; }
  </style>

  <!-- ══════════════ SLIDE 1 — NDR by Market ══════════════ -->
  <div class="ndr-slide">
    <div class="ndr-hd">
      <span class="ndr-hd-t">NDR by Market</span>
      <span class="ndr-hd-p">{{ config.month_label }}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="ndr-mkt-row">
      <div class="ndr-mkt-wrap">
        <p class="ndr-sub">NDR and its components by market · Aug-26 close · spot FX · components in pp of opening ARR</p>

        <table class="ndr-mkt">
          <thead>
            <tr class="ndr-mkt-h">
              <th>Market</th>
              <th class="ndr-c-ndr">NDR</th>
              <th>Net Churn</th>
              <th>Pricing</th>
              <th>Cross-sell</th>
              <th>Upsell</th>
              <th>Disc&amp;Other</th>
              <th class="ndr-c-fx">FX</th>
            </tr>
            <tr class="ndr-mkt-sub">
              <th class="ndr-blank"></th>
              <th class="ndr-blank"></th>
              <th class="ndr-blank"></th>
              <th class="ndr-blank"></th>
              <th colspan="3">&#8618; Net Upgrades</th>
              <th class="ndr-blank"></th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Colombia</td>
              <td class="ndr-c-ndr">111.6%<sup class="ndr-fn">1</sup></td>
              <td class="ndr-neg">(23.8)</td>
              <td>3.2</td>
              <td class="ndr-nil">–</td>
              <td>3.8</td>
              <td>3.1</td>
              <td class="ndr-c-fx">25.3</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Mexico</td>
              <td class="ndr-c-ndr">85.8%</td>
              <td class="ndr-neg">(21.6)</td>
              <td>0.6</td>
              <td class="ndr-neg">(0.1)</td>
              <td class="ndr-neg">(2.1)<sup class="ndr-fn">2</sup></td>
              <td>1.5</td>
              <td class="ndr-c-fx">7.4</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Dominican Rep.</td>
              <td class="ndr-c-ndr">79.1%</td>
              <td class="ndr-neg">(23.2)</td>
              <td>0.5</td>
              <td class="ndr-nil">–</td>
              <td>0.1</td>
              <td>1.7</td>
              <td class="ndr-c-fx ndr-nil">–</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Costa Rica</td>
              <td class="ndr-c-ndr">79.9%</td>
              <td class="ndr-neg">(22.8)</td>
              <td class="ndr-nil">–</td>
              <td class="ndr-neg">(0.7)</td>
              <td class="ndr-nil">–</td>
              <td>3.5</td>
              <td class="ndr-c-fx ndr-nil">–</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="ndr-tot">
              <td>Total</td>
              <td class="ndr-c-ndr">101.0%</td>
              <td>(23.7)</td>
              <td>2.7</td>
              <td class="ndr-nil">–</td>
              <td>2.7</td>
              <td>2.8</td>
              <td class="ndr-c-fx">16.6</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>

        <p class="ndr-mkt-notes">
          <sup>1</sup>&nbsp;Only market above 100% NDR. &nbsp;&nbsp;<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;Only market with negative Net Upsell.<br>
          Components are pp of opening ARR and are rounded to one decimal, so rows may not foot to NDR by ±0.1pp. Parentheses denote a negative; “–” denotes nil.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="ndr-rail">
        <div class="ndr-rail-l">Notes</div>
        <div class="ndr-note">
          <span class="ndr-note-n">01</span>
          <span class="ndr-note-t">Excluding the FX line, group NDR is <b>84.4%</b> (101.0% less 16.6pp) — everything above 100% is currency.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ndr-note-hr"></div>
        <div class="ndr-note">
          <span class="ndr-note-n">02</span>
          <span class="ndr-note-t">Same basis, <b>Colombia is 86.3%</b>, not 111.6% — its +25.3pp tailwind is the largest in the group.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ndr-note-hr"></div>
        <div class="ndr-note">
          <span class="ndr-note-n">03</span>
          <span class="ndr-note-t">DR and Costa Rica carry no FX at all, so their <b>79.1%</b> and <b>79.9%</b> already show underlying retention.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ndr-ft">
      <span class="ndr-ft-b">ALEGRA</span>
      <span class="ndr-ft-s">ARR walk (By Version) + dwh_facts.fact_customers_mrr · FX spot, Aug-26 close TRM</span>
      <span class="ndr-ft-p">NDR · 1/4</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="slide-divider">↓ &nbsp; 2 / 4</div>

  <!-- ══════════════ SLIDE 2 — NDR bridge ══════════════ -->
  <div class="ndr-slide">
    <div class="ndr-hd">
      <span class="ndr-hd-t">How NDR Has Evolved</span>
      <span class="ndr-hd-p">{{ config.month_label }}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="ndr-br-wrap">
      <p class="ndr-sub">A useful way to look at the evolution is through the following bridge — global, spot FX · Aug-23 / Aug-24 / Aug-25 / Aug-26</p>

      <div class="ndr-br-center">
        <table class="ndr-br">
          <colgroup>
            <col class="ndr-br-c1"><col class="ndr-br-cp"><col class="ndr-br-cp"><col class="ndr-br-cp"><col class="ndr-br-cp"><col class="ndr-br-ce">
          </colgroup>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>NDR driver</th>
              <th class="ndr-br-per">Aug-23</th>
              <th class="ndr-br-per">Aug-24</th>
              <th class="ndr-br-per">Aug-25</th>
              <th class="ndr-br-per ndr-cur">Aug-26</th>
              <th class="ndr-br-exp">Long-term</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="ndr-br-r">
              <td>Opening ARR</td>
              <td class="ndr-base">100.0</td>
              <td class="ndr-base">100.0</td>
              <td class="ndr-base">100.0</td>
              <td class="ndr-base ndr-cur">100.0</td>
              <td class="ndr-br-e ndr-mut">Baseline</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="ndr-br-r">
              <td>Net Churn</td>
              <td class="ndr-neg">(27.0)</td>
              <td class="ndr-neg">(24.4)</td>
